<title>USA: Arrow-Magnolia sets 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Arrow-Magnolia sets 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arrow-Magnolia International Inc set a ten percent stock dividend for shareholders of record as of July 15, 1997.</p>
<p>The additional shares will be issued as soon as practicable after the record date, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>As of the end of the company's first quarter, it had about 2.9 million shares outstanding.</p>
